{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} to explore habit-forward coaching and membership options.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f6fbfb; --card:#ffffff; --muted:#6b7680; --accent:#2b7a78; --accent-2:#1f5f5d; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
      --radius:12px; --ease:cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1);
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{
      margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
      background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg) 0%, #eef6f6 60%);
      color:#16323a; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      line-height:1.45; font-size:16px; padding:32px;
    }
    .site{
      max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; position:relative;
      background-image: url('assets/img/pattern.svg'); background-repeat:repeat; padding:28px; border-radius:18px;
      box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(15,30,30,0.06);
      overflow:hidden;
    }
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;margin-bottom:20px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{color:var(--accent-2);text-decoration:none;margin:0 10px;font-weight:600}
    nav{display:flex;align-items:center}
    .cta{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    .panel{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(20,40,40,0.04)}

    /* Hero */
    .hero{padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.9), rgba(255,255,255,0.8));}
    h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:24px;color:#0f2b2a}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Contact form */
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #e3ecec;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .row > *{flex:1}
    .submit{display:inline-flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:none;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Proof gallery */
    .proof{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
    .testimonial{min-height:110px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;justify-content:center;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbffff, #f8ffff);border:1px solid #e7f3f3}
    .quote{font-style:italic;color:#083034}
    .who{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-2)}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--glass);border:1px solid rgba(31,95,93,0.06);cursor:default;position:relative}
    .badge svg{width:18px;height:18px;flex:0 0 18px}
    .tooltip{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);bottom:calc(100% + 8px);background:rgba(6,18,17,0.95);color:white;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .16s var(--ease)}
    .badge:hover .tooltip{opacity:1}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .comparator{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .toggle{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
    .switch{width:52px;height:28px;background:#e6f5f4;border-radius:999px;padding:4px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;cursor:pointer}
    .knob{width:20px;height:20px;background:white;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(8,20,20,0.12);transform:translateX(0);transition:transform .28s var(--ease)}
    .switch.on{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2))}
    .switch.on .knob{transform:translateX(24px)}
    .prices{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline}
    .price{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent-2)}
    .label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    footer{margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    @media (max-width:960px){
      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      header{flex-wrap:wrap}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="site" role="main">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo" aria-hidden>WC</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Thoughtful coaching · habit-led membership</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="about.html">Approach</a>
        <a href="programs.html">Pathways</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Plans</a>
        <a href="testimonials.html">Stories</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a class="cta" href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="grid">
      <section class="panel hero" aria-labelledby="contact-hero">
        <h1 id="contact-hero">Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</h1>
        <p class="lead">Share what you want to change and which rhythms you want to shape. We'll respond with next actions and a suggested membership path.</p>

        <div style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <a class="submit" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <div class="meta">Prefer a call? Ring us at <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> or email <strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong>.</div>
        </div>

        <hr style="margin:18px 0;border:none;border-top:1px dashed rgba(12,30,30,0.06)">

        <form id="contactForm" class="contact" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();submitInquiry()">
          <div class="row">
            <div>
              <label for="name">Name</label>
              <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Your full name" required>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div>
              <label for="phone">Phone</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="text" placeholder="Optional">
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="interest">Interested in</label>
              <select id="interest" name="interest">
                <option>Intro session</option>
                <option>Rhythm Membership</option>
                <option>Focused short-term package</option>
                <option>Corporate / Group offering</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="message">Message / goals</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="What would you like to focus on? Habits, routines, or a specific challenge."></textarea>
          </div>

          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:6px">
            <div class="meta">We prioritize clarity: you'll receive a short plan and next steps.</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px">
              <button class="submit" type="submit">Send inquiry</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </form>

        <footer>
          <div>Address: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} · Email: {{EMAIL}} · Phone: {{PHONE}}</div>
        </footer>
      </section>

      <aside class="panel">
        <div class="proof">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div>
              <div style="font-weight:800">Proof Gallery</div>
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Rotating client notes and the badges that back our method.</div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
              <button id="prev" aria-label="Previous testimonial" style="border:none;background:#eef7f7;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer">◀</button>
              <button id="next" aria-label="Next testimonial" style="border:none;background:#eef7f7;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer">▶</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="testimonial" class="testimonial" role="region" aria-live="polite">
            <div class="quote" id="quote">Loading feedback...</div>
            <div class="who" id="who"></div>
            <div class="badges" id="badges">
              <!-- badges injected here -->
            </div>
          </div>

          <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px dashed rgba(12,30,30,0.06)">

          <div class="comparator" aria-label="Pricing comparator">
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
              <div>
                <div style="font-weight:800">Pricing comparator</div>
                <div class="label">Toggle to compare monthly vs. focused package pricing</div>
              </div>
              <div class="toggle">
                <div id="switch" class="switch" role="switch" aria-checked="false" tabindex="0">
                  <div class="knob"></div>
                </div>
                <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)" id="modeLabel">Monthly</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="prices">
              <div>
                <div class="label">Rhythm Membership</div>
                <div class="price" id="price-membership" data-monthly="89" data-package="240">$<span>89</span></div>
                <div class="label">Month-to-month or 3-session package</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="label">Focus Block (6 weeks)</div>
                <div class="price" id="price-package" data-monthly="195" data-package="1150">$<span>195</span></div>
                <div class="label">Short-term, concentrated coaching</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">Numbers animate for clarity; package prices reflect bundled savings.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // --- Proof Gallery data and rotation ---
    const testimonials = [
      {
        quote: "I relearned how small shifts in timing made my days feel manageable again. The membership kept me honest.",
        who: "A. Martinez — Creative Director",
        badges: [
          {label: 'Certified Habit Coach', icon: 'M2 12a10 10 0 1 0 20 0 10 10 0 0 0-20 0z'},
          {label: 'Corporate workshops', icon: 'M4 4h16v2H4z M4 8h16v2H4z M4 12h10v2H4z'}
        ]
      },
      {
        quote: "We built a simple nightly rhythm that improved sleep onset and morning focus. The coach gave steady structure, not pressure.",
        who: "R. Patel — Product Manager",
        badges: [
          {label: 'Sleep-informed tools', icon: 'M12 2c-4 0-8 3-8 7 0 4 4 7 8 7s8-3 8-7c0-4-4-7-8-7z'},
          {label: '6-week focus blocks', icon: 'M6 6h12v12H6z'}
        ]
      },
      {
        quote: "The monthly rhythm membership felt like a maintenance plan—steady check-ins, quick adjustments, reliable progress.",
        who: "S. Nguyen — Educator",
        badges: [
          {label: 'Ongoing membership', icon: 'M12 2v10l4 2'},
          {label: 'Toolkit & worksheets', icon: 'M4 6h12v10H4z'}
        ]
      }
    ];

    let current = 0;
    const quoteEl = document.getElementById('quote');
    const whoEl = document.getElementById('who');
    const badgesEl = document.getElementById('badges');
    const testimonialEl = document.getElementById('testimonial');

    function renderTestimonial(i){
      const t = testimonials[i % testimonials.length];
      quoteEl.textContent = '“' + t.quote + '”';
      whoEl.textContent = t.who;
      badgesEl.innerHTML = '';
      t.badges.forEach(b => {
        const bwrap = document.createElement('div');
        bwrap.className = 'badge';
        bwrap.setAttribute('tabindex','0');
        bwrap.innerHTML = `
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden><path d="${b.icon}"/></svg>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">${b.label}</div>
          <div class="tooltip">${b.label}</div>
        `;
        badgesEl.appendChild(bwrap);
      });
    }

    renderTestimonial(current);

    document.getElementById('prev').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ current = (current - 1 + testimonials.length) % testimonials.length; renderTestimonial(current); });
    document.getElementById('next').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ current = (current + 1) % testimonials.length; renderTestimonial(current); });

    // Auto-rotate with gentle pause on hover
    let rotateTimer = setInterval(()=>{ current = (current + 1) % testimonials.length; renderTestimonial(current); }, 6000);
    testimonialEl.addEventListener('mouseenter', ()=>clearInterval(rotateTimer));
    testimonialEl.addEventListener('mouseleave', ()=>{ rotateTimer = setInterval(()=>{ current = (current + 1) % testimonials.length; renderTestimonial(current); }, 6000); });

    // --- Pricing comparator with animated numbers ---
    const switchEl = document.getElementById('switch');
    const modeLabel = document.getElementById('modeLabel');
    const priceMembership = document.getElementById('price-membership');
    const pricePackage = document.getElementById('price-package');

    function animateNumber(el, from, to, duration=600){
      const span = el.querySelector('span');
      const start = performance.now();
      requestAnimationFrame(function run(now){
        const t = Math.min(1, (now - start) / duration);
        const eased = (--t)*t*t+1; // easeOutCubic
        const val = Math.round(from + (to - from) * eased);
        span.textContent = val.toString();
        if(now - start < duration) requestAnimationFrame(run);
      });
    }

    function setMode(isPackage){
      if(isPackage){
        switchEl.classList.add('on');
        switchEl.setAttribute('aria-checked','true');
        modeLabel.textContent = 'Package';
      } else {
        switchEl.classList.remove('on');
        switchEl.setAttribute('aria-checked','false');
        modeLabel.textContent = 'Monthly';
      }
      const mFrom = Number(priceMembership.querySelector('span').textContent);
      const pFrom = Number(pricePackage.querySelector('span').textContent);
      const mTo = Number(priceMembership.getAttribute(isPackage ? 'data-package' : 'data-monthly'));
      const pTo = Number(pricePackage.getAttribute(isPackage ? 'data-package' : 'data-monthly'));
      animateNumber(priceMembership, mFrom, mTo);
      animateNumber(pricePackage, pFrom, pTo);
    }

    switchEl.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ const isOn = switchEl.classList.toggle('on'); setMode(isOn); });
    switchEl.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{ if(e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') { e.preventDefault(); const isOn = switchEl.classList.toggle('on'); setMode(isOn); } });

    // Initialize numeric display from attributes
    priceMembership.querySelector('span').textContent = priceMembership.getAttribute('data-monthly');
    pricePackage.querySelector('span').textContent = pricePackage.getAttribute('data-monthly');

    // --- Form handling (local-only) ---
    function submitInquiry(){
      const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
      const data = new FormData(form);
      const payload = {};
      data.forEach((v,k)=>payload[k]=v);
      // For local demo: show a temporary confirmation
      const origBtn = document.querySelector('.contact .submit');
      const text = origBtn.textContent;
      origBtn.textContent = 'Sending...';
      origBtn.disabled = true;
      setTimeout(()=>{
        origBtn.textContent = 'Sent — we will reply within 48 hours';
        form.reset();
        setTimeout(()=>{ origBtn.textContent = text; origBtn.disabled = false; }, 3000);
      }, 900);
      console.log('Contact payload (local demo):', payload);
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page + notes for wellness_coach site

Files in this chunk:
- contact.html — The contact page of the site with a built-in Proof Gallery and a Pricing Comparator micro-interaction.

How to view locally:
1. Place this file alongside the rest of the site files (index.html, about.html, services.html, programs.html, pricing.html, testimonials.html, book.html) and the assets folder containing assets/img/pattern.svg.
2. Open contact.html in a modern browser (no server required for basic interactions).

Features implemented on contact.html:
- Contact form (local demo): collects name, email, phone, interest and message. Submission is handled locally and shows a temporary confirmation. Replace with real endpoint as needed.
- Proof Gallery: Rotating testimonials with next/previous controls, auto-rotate, pause-on-hover. Each testimonial shows a set of credibility badges. Badges present a tooltip on hover and are keyboard-focusable.
- Pricing Comparator: Toggle (keyboard accessible) that switches between monthly and package pricing. Numeric transitions animate smoothly for clarity.

Placeholders to replace in your environment (keep exact token strings):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Notes & constraints followed:
- No external fonts, assets or CDNs are referenced. The page references assets/img/pattern.svg for the background pattern (include a unique SVG at that path).
- Copy avoids medical claims and focuses on outcomes, habits, and frameworks.
- Visual elements use inline SVG icons and CSS only.

Accessibility & small details:
- The proof gallery uses aria-live for testimonial updates.
- The toggle implements role="switch" and supports keyboard activation.

If you need the pattern.svg or additional pages for this project, request the next chunk and I will generate them (unique pattern SVG will be provided as required)."} 
BUNDLE_END
